cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the reported decomposition, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "CAFE: Decomposing the Reported Number in Weakly Supervised Video Anomaly Detection"
abstract: >-
  Code, per-frame scores, ground truth and manuscript for a measurement study of
  the pooled AUC used to evaluate weakly supervised video anomaly detectors.
  The reported number is decomposed exactly into a cross-video block, a
  within-video block and a residual block; the within-video block is shown to be
  mediated rather than confounded by motion, and is shown not to predict any
  independent localization metric.
